{"suttaId":"sn35.156","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"S-iv","vriCode":"s0304m.mul","paras":[975,975],"vripara":"156"},"segments":{"sn35.156:0.3":"Ajjhattanandikkhayasuttaṃ","sn35.156:1.1":"“Aniccaṃyeva, bhikkhave, bhikkhu cakkhuṃ aniccanti passati, sāssa [sāyaṃ (pī. ka.)] hoti sammādiṭṭhi.","sn35.156:1.2":"Sammā passaṃ nibbindati.","sn35.156:1.3":"Nandikkhayā rāgakkhayo;","sn35.156:1.4":"rāgakkhayā nandikkhayo.","sn35.156:1.5":"Nandirāgakkhayā cittaṃ suvimuttanti vuccati … pe … aniccaṃyeva, bhikkhave, bhikkhu jivhaṃ aniccanti passati, sāssa hoti sammādiṭṭhi.","sn35.156:1.7":"Sammā passaṃ nibbindati.","sn35.156:1.8":"Nandikkhayā rāgakkhayo;","sn35.156:1.9":"rāgakkhayā … pe … cittaṃ suvimuttanti vuccati … pe … aniccaṃyeva, bhikkhave, bhikkhu manaṃ aniccanti passati, sāssa hoti sammādiṭṭhi.","sn35.156:1.12":"Sammā passaṃ nibbindati.","sn35.156:1.13":"Nandikkhayā rāgakkhayo;","sn35.156:1.14":"rāgakkhayā nandikkhayo.","sn35.156:1.15":"Nandirāgakkhayā cittaṃ suvimuttanti vuccatī”ti.","sn35.156:1.16":"Paṭhamaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Spk-iv","bookName":"Saḷāyatanavagga-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0304a.att","from":280,"to":280,"paras":[{"para":280,"vripara":"156-159","refs":["sn35.156:1"],"words":["suvimuttaṃ"],"lines":["156-159. Nandikkhayavaggassa paṭhame <b>nandikkhayā rāgakkhayo, rāgakkhayā nandikkhayo</b>ti nandiyā ca rāgassa ca atthato ekattā vuttaṃ.","<b>Suvimuttan</b>ti arahattaphalavimuttivasena suṭṭhu vimuttaṃ.","Sesamettha dutiyādīsu ca uttānameva."],"lineRefs":[["sn35.156:1"],["sn35.156:1"],["sn35.156:1"]]}]},"tika":{"book":"Spk-t-iv","bookName":"Saḷāyatanavagga-ṭīkā","vriCode":"s0304t.tik","from":296,"to":296,"paras":[{"para":296,"vripara":"156-159","refs":["sn35.156:1"],"words":["nandī","rāgo"],"lines":["156-159. <b>Atthato</b>ti sabhāvato.","Ñāṇena ariyato ñātabbato <b>attho,</b> sabhāvoti.","Evañhi abhijjanasabhāvo nandanaṭṭhena <b>nandī,</b> rañjanaṭṭhena <b>rāgo.</b>","<b>Vimuttivasenā</b>ti vimuttiyā adhigamavasena.","<b>Etthā</b>ti imasmiṃ paṭhamasutte.","<b>Dutiyādīsū</b>ti dutiyatatiyacatutthesu.","<b>Uttānameva</b> heṭṭhā vuttanayattā."],"lineRefs":[["sn35.156:1"],["sn35.156:1"],["sn35.156:1"],["sn35.156:1"],["sn35.156:1"],["sn35.156:1"],["sn35.156:1"]]}]}}
